{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}
{#
 ⚠ THIS PAGE IS THE SPECIFICATION FOR THE "scout year transition"
 END-TO-END TEST: tests/e2e/specs/scout-year-transition.spec.js.

 That test replays, in a real browser, exactly the workflow described
 below — the three phases, every step in order, the steps that vanish
 when their module is off, the ones a human marks versus the ones the
 site observes, the fact that the order is advice rather than a gate,
 the blocks that are real (an import before the staff year; the staff
 year, the import and the registration veto before the public one), the
 preview that is scoped to one session, the staff year that the public
 must not see, and the final switch that clears the staff year. It reads
 the labels off this page rather than copying them, but it cannot guess a
 change of plan.

 **Any change to this workflow must be reflected in that test, in the same
 change**: a step added, removed or reordered, a new blocking condition, a
 new control, or simply rewording a label the test relies on. The steps
 and phases themselves come from Core\ScoutYear\ScoutYearTransitionService,
 which carries the same reminder.

 The test is blocking: it fails CI (the "End-to-end (browser)" job) and
 the release, whose CI gate requires that job green. See
 docs/developpement.md § Tests de bout en bout.

 Everything that changes when someone acts lives in
 admin/scout_year/_state.html.twig, which ScoutYearController renders
 both here and as the JSON answer of every action on this page
 (CHANTIER-annee-scoute.md §2.8): public/assets/js/admin-scout-year.js swaps it in
 place of #scout-year-state, so there is one rendering of the page and
 no copy of it in JavaScript. The forms inside it post to the same
 routes without JavaScript, which is the fallback.
#}
{% block title %}Année scoute — {{ param('site_name') }}{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
    <div id="scout-year-state" data-scout-year-state>
        {% include 'admin/scout_year/_state.html.twig' %}
    </div>
{% endblock %}

{% block scripts %}
<script src="{{ asset('/assets/js/admin-scout-year.js') }}" defer nonce="{{ csp_nonce }}"></script>
{% endblock %}
